## Document Hierarchy (read before coding)

| Scope | CLAUDE.md | `.cursorrules` |
|-------|-----------|----------------|
| **Root** | [`CLAUDE.md`](CLAUDE.md) | this file |
| **Backend** | [`backend/CLAUDE.md`](backend/CLAUDE.md) | [`backend/.cursorrules`](backend/.cursorrules) |
| **Frontend** | [`frontend/CLAUDE.md`](frontend/CLAUDE.md) | [`frontend/.cursorrules`](frontend/.cursorrules) |
| **Domain app** | `backend/apps/{app}/.docs/CLAUDE.md` | `backend/apps/{app}/.docs/.cursorrules` |

Sibling apps under `backend/apps/` each get their own `.docs/` pair (e.g. [`titanic`](backend/apps/titanic/_docs/CLAUDE.md)).

