## TOP-LEVEL: Architectural Blueprint (summary)

Aligned with [`CLAUDE.md`](CLAUDE.md) § Architectural Blueprint.

1. **Harness Engineering & PKS** — programmatic agent/human scaffolding; wiki + LLM as first-class data.
2. **SOLID + Hexagonal + DDD** — domain pure; application orchestrates; adapters own I/O.

---> **Backend module pathing** → [`backend/CLAUDE.md`](backend/CLAUDE.md)

---> **Frontend React rules** → [`frontend/CLAUDE.md`](frontend/CLAUDE.md) + [`docs/DevOps/Frontend/REACT_RULES.md`](docs/DevOps/Frontend/REACT_RULES.md)

---> **Domain app rules** → `backend/apps/{app}/.docs/CLAUDE.md`

