## SUBORDINATE: Agent Behavioral Guidelines

Full detail: [`CLAUDE.md`](CLAUDE.md) § Agent Behavioral Guidelines.

1. **Think Before Coding** — assumptions, ambiguity, trade-offs; stop and ask when unclear.
2. **Simplicity First** — request scope only; no speculative abstractions.
3. **Surgical Changes** — every changed line ties to the request.
4. **Goal-Driven Execution** — verifiable success criteria; loop until met.

